SUMMARY:Market Update
DESCRIPTION:What topics will be covered?\nThis meeting will cover the bi-weekly market performance report, recent price corrections and any general market questions or issues. \nWho should attend?\nMarket participants\nWeb and audio participation information\nStep 1: join web conference at https://caiso.webex.com/caiso/j.php?MTID=m910a478197e7534180b0345dfcb137c8 \nStep 2: connect audio by selecting computer audio or selecting call me and enter your phone number\nAudio only participation: call 1-844-621-3956 or 1-650-479-3208 (toll), access code: 2498 963 7516\nTechnical support: call Intellor at 1-301-250-7202\n\nJennie Araj at jaraj@caiso.com \n\nView more information on this event and its related documents: https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/market-update-apr-30-2026-1000-am
