SUMMARY:Market Update
DESCRIPTION:What topics will be covered?\nThis meeting will cover the bi-weekly market performance report, recent price corrections and any general market questions or issues. \nWho should attend?\nMarket participants\nWeb and audio participation information\nStep 1: join web conference at https://caiso.webex.com/caiso/j.php?MTID=m910a478197e7534180b0345dfcb137c8 \nStep 2: connect audio by selecting computer audio or selecting call me and enter your phone number\nAudio only participation: call 1-844-621-3956 or 1-650-479-3208 (toll), access code: 2498 963 7516\nTechnical support: call Intellor at 1-301-250-7202\n\nJennie Araj at jaraj@caiso.com \n\nView more information on this event and its related documents: https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/market-update-mar-19-2026-1000-am
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<html><body lang="EN-US" link="#0072BC" vlink="#03519A" style="font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;" ><div><p style="margin-left:0in;"><strong>What topics will be covered?</strong></p><p style="margin-left:0in;">This meeting will cover the bi-weekly market performance report, recent price corrections and any general market questions or issues.  </p><p style="margin-left:0in;"><strong>Who should attend?</strong></p><p style="margin-left:0in;">Market participants</p><p style="margin-left:0in;"><strong>Web and audio participation information</strong></p><p>Step 1: join web conference at <a target="_blank" href="https://caiso.webex.com/caiso/j.php?MTID=m910a478197e7534180b0345dfcb137c8" rel="noreferrer noopener">https://caiso.webex.com/caiso/j.php?MTID=m910a478197e7534180b0345dfcb137c8</a></p><p>Step 2: connect audio by selecting <i>computer audio</i> or selecting <i>call me</i> and enter your phone number</p><p>Audio only participation: call 1-844-621-3956 or 1-650-479-3208 (toll), access code: 2498 963 7516</p><p>Technical support: call  Intellor  at 1-301-250-7202</p></div><div><p>Jennie Araj at <a href="mailto:jaraj@caiso.com">jaraj@caiso.com</a></p></div><div><p><a href="https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/market-update-mar-19-2026-1000-am" target="_blank">View more information on this event and its related documents.</a></p></div></body></html>
