DESCRIPTION:NOTE: Do not add to personal calendar. Meeting date and details to be confirmed in a future notice. \nWhat topics will be covered?\nReview the Mixed-Fuel and Distribution Level Resource paper and Outage Management topic group paper.\nNote that the Issue Paper and Straw Proposal on Mixed-Fuel and Distribution-Level Resources is scheduled for posting on Feb. 11, 2026.\nCategories\nMarkets\nWeb and audio participation information\nStep 1: join web conference at https://intellor.webex.com/intellor/j.php?MTID=m057e89b5d96fb930c5a1c1fb226272ff \nStep 2: connect audio by selecting computer audio or selecting call me and enter your phone number\nAudio only participation: call 1-844-621-3956, access code: 25346222747\nTechnical support: call Intellor at 1-301-250-7202\n\nBrenda Marquez at bmarquez@caiso.com or ISOstakeholderaffairs@caiso.com \n\nView more information on this event and its related documents: https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/storage-design-and-modeling-mar-11-2026-0900-am
