DESCRIPTION:The Congestion Revenue Rights (CRR) Settlement Upgrade Project Customer Partnership Group will hold a meeting on Mar. 10, 2026 to discuss production updates.\nWhat topics will be covered?\nReview the production updates\nWho should attend?\nAudience is the Congestion Revenue Rights (CRR) market participants and vendors.\nWeb and audio participation information\nStep 1: join web conference at https://intellor.webex.com/intellor/j.php?MTID=m54c10d497b3bec296b51b7c5df207ef5 \nStep 2: connect audio by selecting computer audio or selecting call me and enter your phone number\nAudio only participation: call 1-844-621-3956, access code: 25396834676 \nTechnical support: call Intellor at 1-301-250-7202\nMeeting notice - https://www.caiso.com/notices/customer-partnership-group-for-congestion-revenue-rights-meeting-on-3-10-26 \n\nBrenda Marquez, bmarquez@caiso.com \n\nView more information on this event and its related documents: https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/congestion-revenue-rights-crr-customer-partnership-group-mar-10-2026-1000-am
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<html><body lang="EN-US" link="#0072BC" vlink="#03519A" style="font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;" ><div><p style="margin-left:0in;">The Congestion Revenue Rights (CRR) Settlement Upgrade Project Customer Partnership Group will hold a meeting on Mar. 10, 2026 to discuss production updates.</p><p style="margin-left:0in;"><strong>What topics will be covered?</strong></p><ul><li><p style="margin-left:0in;">Review the production updates</p></li></ul><p style="margin-left:0in;"><strong>Who should attend?</strong></p><p style="margin-left:0in;">Audience is the Congestion Revenue Rights (CRR) market participants and vendors.</p><p style="margin-left:0in;"><strong>Web and audio participation information</strong></p><p>Step 1: join web conference at <a target="_blank" href="https://intellor.webex.com/intellor/j.php?MTID=m54c10d497b3bec296b51b7c5df207ef5" rel="noreferrer noopener">https://intellor.webex.com/intellor/j.php?MTID=m54c10d497b3bec296b51b7c5df207ef5</a></p><p>Step 2: connect audio by selecting <i>computer audio</i> or selecting <i>call me</i> and enter your phone number</p><p>Audio only participation: call 1-844-621-3956, access code: 25396834676  </p><p>Technical support: call  Intellor  at 1-301-250-7202</p><p><strong>Meeting notice</strong> - <a target="_blank" href="https://www.caiso.com/notices/customer-partnership-group-for-congestion-revenue-rights-meeting-on-3-10-26" rel="noreferrer noopener">https://www.caiso.com/notices/customer-partnership-group-for-congestion-revenue-rights-meeting-on-3-10-26</a></p></div><div><p>Brenda Marquez, <a href="mailto:bmarquez@caiso.com">bmarquez@caiso.com</a></p></div><div><p><a href="https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/congestion-revenue-rights-crr-customer-partnership-group-mar-10-2026-1000-am" target="_blank">View more information on this event and its related documents.</a></p></div></body></html>
