UID:222472@caiso.com
DTSTART:20260302T210000Z
DTEND:20260303T000000Z
SUMMARY:Interconnection Process Enhancements 5.0 Revised Final Proposal
DESCRIPTION:The California ISO will post a revised final proposal for the Interconnection Process Enhancements 5.0 initiative to the initiative webpage by end of day Feb. 25, 2026, and will host a virtual stakeholder meeting on March 2, 2026, to discuss this proposal. In addition, the ISO will also post a document focusing only on the limited changes and clarifications to the final proposal.\nWhat topics will be covered?\nDiscuss the revised final proposal \nCategories\nMarkets\nOperations\nPlanning\nWeb and audio participation information\nStep 1: join web conference at https://intellor.webex.com/intellor/j.php?MTID=m65a8b92074278ea0a7e24012ca7ecbcd \nStep 2: connect audio by selecting computer audio or selecting call me and enter your phone number\nAudio only participation: call 1-844-621-3956, access code: 25396154857\nTechnical support: call Intellor at 1-301-250-7202\nRelated information\nMeeting notice - https://www.caiso.com/notices/interconnection-process-enhancements-5-0-revised-final-proposal-posting--call-on-3-2-26 \n\nYelena Kopylov-Alford, ykopylovalford@caiso.com \n\nView more information on this event and its related documents: https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/interconnection-process-enhancements-5-0-revised-final-proposal-mar-02-2026-0100-pm
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<html><body lang="EN-US" link="#0072BC" vlink="#03519A" style="font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;" ><div><p style="margin-left:0in;">The California ISO will post a revised final proposal for the Interconnection Process Enhancements 5.0 initiative to the <a target="_blank" href="https://stakeholdercenter.caiso.com/StakeholderInitiatives/Interconnection-process-enhancements-5-0" rel="noreferrer noopener">initiative webpage</a> by end of day Feb. 25, 2026, and will host a virtual stakeholder meeting on March 2, 2026, to discuss this proposal. In addition, the ISO will also post a document focusing only on the limited changes and clarifications to the final proposal.</p><p style="margin-left:0in;"><strong>What topics will be covered?</strong></p><ul><li><p style="margin-left:0in;">Discuss the revised final proposal  </p></li></ul><p style="margin-left:0in;"><strong>Categories</strong></p><ul><li><p style="margin-left:0in;">Markets</p></li><li><p style="margin-left:0in;">Operations</p></li><li><p style="margin-left:0in;">Planning</p></li></ul><p style="margin-left:0in;"><strong>Web and audio participation information</strong></p><p>Step 1: join web conference at <a target="_blank" href="https://intellor.webex.com/intellor/j.php?MTID=m65a8b92074278ea0a7e24012ca7ecbcd" rel="noreferrer noopener">https://intellor.webex.com/intellor/j.php?MTID=m65a8b92074278ea0a7e24012ca7ecbcd</a></p><p>Step 2: connect audio by selecting <i>computer audio</i> or selecting <i>call me</i> and enter your phone number</p><p>Audio only participation: call 1-844-621-3956, access code: 25396154857</p><p>Technical support: call  Intellor  at 1-301-250-7202</p><p><strong>Related information</strong></p><p>Meeting notice - <a target="_blank" href="https://www.caiso.com/notices/interconnection-process-enhancements-5-0-revised-final-proposal-posting--call-on-3-2-26" rel="noreferrer noopener">https://www.caiso.com/notices/interconnection-process-enhancements-5-0-revised-final-proposal-posting--call-on-3-2-26</a></p></div><div><p>Yelena Kopylov-Alford, <a href="mailto:ykopylovalford@caiso.com">ykopylovalford@caiso.com</a></p></div><div><p><a href="https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/interconnection-process-enhancements-5-0-revised-final-proposal-mar-02-2026-0100-pm" target="_blank">View more information on this event and its related documents.</a></p></div></body></html>
URL:https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/interconnection-process-enhancements-5-0-revised-final-proposal-mar-02-2026-0100-pm
