UID:222198@caiso.com
DTSTART:20260302T170000Z
DTEND:20260302T200000Z
SUMMARY:Resource Adequacy Modeling and Program Design (RAMPD) Track 2 - RAAIM Reform Options
DESCRIPTION:The California ISO will host a Resource Adequacy Modeling and Program Design (RAMPD) Track 2 - Outage and Substitution public stakeholder call on Mar. 2, 2026.\nWhat topics will be covered?\nDiscuss Resource Adequacy Availability Incentive Mechanism (RAAIM) reform options\nCategories\nMarkets\nPlanning \nWeb and audio participation information\nStep 1: join web conference at https://intellor.webex.com/intellor/j.php?MTID=m4b7d403b2ae7ccee21b69db4c1512ad7 \nStep 2: connect audio by selecting computer audio or selecting call me and enter your phone number\nAudio only participation: call 1-844-621-3956, access code: 25349445201\nTechnical support: call Intellor at 1-301-250-7202\n\nChristina Guimera, cguimera@caiso.com \n\nView more information on this event and its related documents: https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/resource-adequacy-modeling-and-program-design-rampd-track-2-raaim-reform-options-mar-02-2026-0900-am
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<html><body lang="EN-US" link="#0072BC" vlink="#03519A" style="font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;" ><div><p>The California ISO will host a Resource Adequacy Modeling and Program Design (RAMPD) Track 2 - Outage and Substitution public stakeholder call on Mar. 2, 2026.</p><p style="margin-left:0in;"><strong>What topics will be covered?</strong></p><ul><li><p style="margin-left:0in;">Discuss Resource Adequacy Availability Incentive Mechanism (RAAIM) reform options</p></li></ul><p style="margin-left:0in;"><strong>Categories</strong></p><ul><li><p style="margin-left:0in;">Markets</p></li><li><p style="margin-left:0in;">Planning  </p></li></ul><p style="margin-left:0in;"><strong>Web and audio participation information</strong></p><p>Step 1: join web conference at <a target="_blank" href="https://intellor.webex.com/intellor/j.php?MTID=m4b7d403b2ae7ccee21b69db4c1512ad7" rel="noreferrer noopener">https://intellor.webex.com/intellor/j.php?MTID=m4b7d403b2ae7ccee21b69db4c1512ad7</a></p><p>Step 2: connect audio by selecting <i>computer audio</i> or selecting <i>call me</i> and enter your phone number</p><p>Audio only participation: call 1-844-621-3956, access code: 25349445201</p><p>Technical support: call  Intellor  at 1-301-250-7202</p></div><div><p>Christina Guimera, <a href="mailto:cguimera@caiso.com">cguimera@caiso.com</a></p></div><div><p><a href="https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/resource-adequacy-modeling-and-program-design-rampd-track-2-raaim-reform-options-mar-02-2026-0900-am" target="_blank">View more information on this event and its related documents.</a></p></div></body></html>
URL:https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/resource-adequacy-modeling-and-program-design-rampd-track-2-raaim-reform-options-mar-02-2026-0900-am
