UID:221781@caiso.com
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260302
SUMMARY:Comments due - 2026 Infrastructure Policy Catalog and Roadmap Process
DESCRIPTION:The California ISO is currently accepting submissions for proposed infrastructure policy initiatives as part of the new 2026 Infrastructure Policy Catalog and Roadmap Process. Stakeholders may submit proposals through Mar. 2, 2026, via the comment template located on the 2026 Infrastructure Catalog and Roadmap webpage.\nPlease use the Commenting Tool to submit comments on this topic to the California ISO.\n\nYelena Kopylov-Alford ykopylovalford@caiso.com or ISOstakeholderaffairs@caiso.com \n\nView more information on this event and its related documents: https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/comments-due-2026-infrastructure-policy-catalog-and-roadmap-process-mar-02-2026-1200-am
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<html><body lang="EN-US" link="#0072BC" vlink="#03519A" style="font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;" ><div><p>The California ISO is currently accepting submissions for proposed infrastructure policy initiatives as part of the new 2026 Infrastructure Policy Catalog and Roadmap Process. Stakeholders may submit proposals through Mar. 2, 2026, via the comment template located on the <a target="_blank" href="https://stakeholdercenter.caiso.com/RecurringStakeholderProcesses/2026-Infrastructure-policy-catalog-and-roadmap-process" rel="noreferrer noopener">2026 Infrastructure Catalog and Roadmap webpage</a>.</p><p>Please use the <a target="_blank" href="https://stakeholdercenter.caiso.com/Account/Login?ReturnUrl=/Comments/MyOrgComments" rel="noreferrer noopener">Commenting Tool</a> to submit comments on this topic to the California ISO.</p></div><div><p>Yelena Kopylov-Alford <a href="mailto:ykopylovalford@caiso.com">ykopylovalford@caiso.com</a> or <a href="mailto:ISOstakeholderaffairs@caiso.com">ISOstakeholderaffairs@caiso.com</a></p></div><div><p><a href="https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/comments-due-2026-infrastructure-policy-catalog-and-roadmap-process-mar-02-2026-1200-am" target="_blank">View more information on this event and its related documents.</a></p></div></body></html>
