DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260302
SUMMARY:Comments due - 2026 Market Policy Catalog and Roadmap Process
DESCRIPTION:The California ISO is currently accepting submissions for proposed market policy initiatives as part of the 2026 Market Policy Catalog and Roadmap process. Stakeholders may submit proposals through Mar. 2, 2026, via the comment template located on the 2026 Market policy catalog and roadmap webpage.\nPlease use the Commenting Tool to submit comments on this topic to the California ISO.\n\nBrenda Marquez at bmarquez@caiso.com or ISOstakeholderaffairs@caiso.com \n\nView more information on this event and its related documents: https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/comments-due-2026-market-policy-catalog-and-roadmap-process-mar-02-2026-1200-am
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<html><body lang="EN-US" link="#0072BC" vlink="#03519A" style="font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;" ><div><p>The California ISO is currently accepting submissions for proposed market policy initiatives as part of the 2026 Market Policy Catalog and Roadmap process. Stakeholders may submit proposals through Mar. 2, 2026, via the comment template located on the <a target="_blank" href="https://stakeholdercenter.caiso.com/RecurringStakeholderProcesses/2026-market-policy-catalog-and-roadmap-process" rel="noreferrer noopener">2026 Market policy catalog and roadmap webpage</a>.</p><p>Please use the <a target="_blank" href="https://stakeholdercenter.caiso.com/Account/Login?ReturnUrl=/Comments/MyOrgComments" rel="noreferrer noopener">Commenting Tool</a> to submit comments on this topic to the California ISO.</p></div><div><p>Brenda Marquez at <a href="mailto:bmarquez@caiso.com">bmarquez@caiso.com</a> or <a href="mailto:ISOstakeholderaffairs@caiso.com">ISOstakeholderaffairs@caiso.com</a></p></div><div><p><a href="https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/comments-due-2026-market-policy-catalog-and-roadmap-process-mar-02-2026-1200-am" target="_blank">View more information on this event and its related documents.</a></p></div></body></html>
