DESCRIPTION:The California ISO will host an online working group series to analyze the impacts of configurable parameters on market outcomes.\nWhat topics will be covered?\nImpacts of configurable parameters on market outcomes\nWho should attend?\nMarket participants\nWeb and audio participation information\nStep 1: join web conference at https://intellor.webex.com/intellor/j.php?MTID=mf79ef7f7ed688c4d71cca87c1f21059e \nStep 2: connect audio by selecting computer audio or selecting call me and enter your phone number\nAudio only participation: call 1-844-621-3956, access code: 2539169 8867\nTechnical support: call Intellor at 1-301-250-7202\nRelated information\nhttps://stakeholdercenter.caiso.com/StakeholderInitiatives/Day-ahead-market-enhancements \nMeeting notice - https://www.caiso.com/notices/day-ahead-market-enhancements-configurable-parameters-implementation-working-group-meeting-on-2-26-26 \n\nChristina Guimera, cguimera@caiso.com \n\nView more information on this event and its related documents: https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/day-ahead-market-enhancements-dame-configurable-parameters-implementation-feb-26-2026-0900-am
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<html><body lang="EN-US" link="#0072BC" vlink="#03519A" style="font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;" ><div><p>The California ISO will host an online working group series to analyze the impacts of configurable parameters on market outcomes.</p><p style="margin-left:0in;"><strong>What topics will be covered?</strong></p><ul><li><p style="margin-left:0in;">Impacts of configurable parameters on market outcomes</p></li></ul><p style="margin-left:0in;"><strong>Who should attend?</strong></p><p style="margin-left:0in;">Market participants</p><p style="margin-left:0in;"><strong>Web and audio participation information</strong></p><p>Step 1: join web conference at <a target="_blank" href="https://intellor.webex.com/intellor/j.php?MTID=mf79ef7f7ed688c4d71cca87c1f21059e" rel="noreferrer noopener">https://intellor.webex.com/intellor/j.php?MTID=mf79ef7f7ed688c4d71cca87c1f21059e</a></p><p>Step 2: connect audio by selecting <i>computer audio</i> or selecting <i>call me</i> and enter your phone number</p><p>Audio only participation: call 1-844-621-3956, access code: 2539169 8867</p><p>Technical support: call  Intellor  at 1-301-250-7202</p><p><strong>Related information</strong></p><p><a target="_blank" href="https://stakeholdercenter.caiso.com/StakeholderInitiatives/Day-ahead-market-enhancements" rel="noreferrer noopener">https://stakeholdercenter.caiso.com/StakeholderInitiatives/Day-ahead-market-enhancements</a></p><p><strong>Meeting notice</strong> - <a target="_blank" href="https://www.caiso.com/notices/day-ahead-market-enhancements-configurable-parameters-implementation-working-group-meeting-on-2-26-26" rel="noreferrer noopener">https://www.caiso.com/notices/day-ahead-market-enhancements-configurable-parameters-implementation-working-group-meeting-on-2-26-26</a></p></div><div><p>Christina Guimera, <a href="mailto:cguimera@caiso.com">cguimera@caiso.com</a></p></div><div><p><a href="https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/day-ahead-market-enhancements-dame-configurable-parameters-implementation-feb-26-2026-0900-am" target="_blank">View more information on this event and its related documents.</a></p></div></body></html>
