DTEND:20260224T000000Z
SUMMARY:Extended Day-Ahead Market (EDAM) Congestion Revenue Allocation - Phase 2
DESCRIPTION:The California ISO will host an online stakeholder call on Feb. 23, 2026, to continue the discussion on Phase 2 of the Extended Day-Ahead Market (EDAM) Congestion Revenue Allocation Initiative. \nWhat topics will be covered?\nContinue the discussion of design principles and analysis to guide policy development in phase 2\nReview stakeholder comments on the analysis and the draft design principals shared at the Dec. 11, working group\nShare updates and next steps for phase 2 \nCategories\nMarkets\nWeb and audio participation information\nStep 1: join web conference at https://intellor.webex.com/intellor/j.php?MTID=m0bedd0f421c78e6530620977be5d9c17 \nStep 2: connect audio by selecting computer audio or selecting call me and enter your phone number\nAudio only participation: call 1-650-479-3208, access code: 25328481750\nTechnical support: call Intellor at 1-301-250-7202\nRelated information\nhttps://stakeholdercenter.caiso.com/StakeholderInitiatives/Extended-day-ahead-market \nMeeting notice - https://www.caiso.com/notices/extended-day-ahead-market-edam-congestion-revenue-allocation-phase-2-working-group-on-2-23-26 \n\nChristina Guimera, cguimera@caiso.com \n\nView more information on this event and its related documents: https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/extended-day-ahead-market-edam-congestion-revenue-allocation-phase-2-feb-23-2026-0100-pm
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<html><body lang="EN-US" link="#0072BC" vlink="#03519A" style="font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;" ><div><p style="margin-left:0in;">The California ISO will host an online stakeholder call on Feb. 23, 2026, to continue the discussion on Phase 2 of the Extended Day-Ahead Market (EDAM) Congestion Revenue Allocation Initiative.  </p><p style="margin-left:0in;"><strong>What topics will be covered?</strong></p><ul><li><p style="margin-left:0in;">Continue the discussion of design principles and analysis to guide policy development in phase 2</p></li><li><p style="margin-left:0in;">Review stakeholder comments on the analysis and the draft design principals shared at the Dec. 11, working group</p></li><li><p style="margin-left:0in;">Share updates and next steps for phase 2  </p></li></ul><p style="margin-left:0in;"><strong>Categories</strong></p><ul><li><p style="margin-left:0in;">Markets</p></li></ul><p style="margin-left:0in;"><strong>Web and audio participation information</strong></p><p>Step 1: join web conference at <a target="_blank" href="https://intellor.webex.com/intellor/j.php?MTID=m0bedd0f421c78e6530620977be5d9c17" rel="noreferrer noopener">https://intellor.webex.com/intellor/j.php?MTID=m0bedd0f421c78e6530620977be5d9c17</a></p><p>Step 2: connect audio by selecting <i>computer audio</i> or selecting <i>call me</i> and enter your phone number</p><p>Audio only participation: call 1-650-479-3208, access code: 25328481750</p><p>Technical support: call  Intellor  at 1-301-250-7202</p><p><strong>Related information</strong></p><p><a target="_blank" href="https://stakeholdercenter.caiso.com/StakeholderInitiatives/Extended-day-ahead-market" rel="noreferrer noopener">https://stakeholdercenter.caiso.com/StakeholderInitiatives/Extended-day-ahead-market</a></p><p><strong>Meeting notice -</strong><a target="_blank" href="https://www.caiso.com/notices/extended-day-ahead-market-edam-congestion-revenue-allocation-phase-2-working-group-on-2-23-26" rel="noreferrer noopener">https://www.caiso.com/notices/extended-day-ahead-market-edam-congestion-revenue-allocation-phase-2-working-group-on-2-23-26</a></p></div><div><p>Christina Guimera, <a href="mailto:cguimera@caiso.com">cguimera@caiso.com</a></p></div><div><p><a href="https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/extended-day-ahead-market-edam-congestion-revenue-allocation-phase-2-feb-23-2026-0100-pm" target="_blank">View more information on this event and its related documents.</a></p></div></body></html>
