DTEND:20260203T220000Z
SUMMARY:Interconnection Customer User Group
DESCRIPTION:The Interconnection Customer User Group bi-weekly call provides an opportunity for CAISO interconnection customers to discuss industry questions and concerns regarding infrastructure policies and processes, including transmission planning and development, interconnection, deliverability, and contracting. This group will meet every other Tuesday from 1:00p.m.-2:00p.m.\nWhat topics will be covered?\nAgendas will generally be industry-drivenTopic suggestions are due by close of business on the Wednesday prior to the meeting to ykopylovalford@caiso.com or ISOStakeholderAffairs@caiso.comA high-level agenda will be posted here by close of business the day prior to the meetingWho should attend?\nThis call is open only to CAISO Interconnection Customers and state agency representativesAttendees must pre-register for the recurring meeting hereRegistration is required for this meeting - Interconnection Customer User Group Registration Link\nNotice - https://www.caiso.com/notices/interconnection-customer-user-group-call-3-18-25 \n\nYelena Kopylov-alford, ykopylovalford@caiso.com \n\nView more information on this event and its related documents: https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/interconnection-customer-user-group-feb-03-2026-0100-pm
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<html><body lang="EN-US" link="#0072BC" vlink="#03519A" style="font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;" ><div><p style="margin-left:0in;">The Interconnection Customer User Group bi-weekly call provides an opportunity for CAISO interconnection customers to discuss industry questions and concerns regarding infrastructure policies and processes, including transmission planning and development, interconnection, deliverability, and contracting. This group will meet every other Tuesday from 1:00p.m.-2:00p.m.</p><p style="margin-left:0in;"><strong>What topics will be covered?</strong></p><ul style="list-style-type:disc;"><li>Agendas will generally be industry-driven</li><li>Topic suggestions are due by close of business on the Wednesday prior to the meeting to <a href="mailto:ykopylovalford@caiso.com">ykopylovalford@caiso.com</a> or <a href="mailto:ISOStakeholderAffairs@caiso.com">ISOStakeholderAffairs@caiso.com</a></li><li>A high-level agenda will be posted here by close of business the day prior to the meeting</li></ul><p style="margin-left:0in;"><strong>Who should attend?</strong></p><ul style="list-style-type:disc;"><li>This call is open only to CAISO Interconnection Customers and state agency representatives</li><li>Attendees must pre-register for the recurring meeting <a target="_blank" href="https://caiso.regfox.com/interconnection-customer-user-group-march-18-2025" rel="noreferrer noopener">here</a></li></ul><p><i><strong>Registration is required for this meeting - </strong></i><a target="_blank" href="https://caiso.regfox.com/interconnection-customer-user-group-march-18-2025" rel="noreferrer noopener"><i><strong>Interconnection Customer User Group Registration Link</strong></i></a></p><p><strong>Notice - </strong><a target="_blank" href="https://www.caiso.com/notices/interconnection-customer-user-group-call-3-18-25" rel="noreferrer noopener">https://www.caiso.com/notices/interconnection-customer-user-group-call-3-18-25</a></p></div><div><p>Yelena Kopylov-alford, <a href="mailto:ykopylovalford@caiso.com">ykopylovalford@caiso.com</a></p></div><div><p><a href="https://www.caiso.com/meetings-events/calendar/interconnection-customer-user-group-feb-03-2026-0100-pm" target="_blank">View more information on this event and its related documents.</a></p></div></body></html>
